mos, trailers, and horror content. Fast turnaround & broadcast quality.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2020-06-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Scream Ghost Face Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>My chilling Ghost Face <strong>male voiceover</strong>, inspired by horror icon Rodger Jackson, is ideal for <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">Halloween</a> ads, promos, and theme park events...</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Classic horror. Killer delivery.</h2>\r\n<p>The iconic 'Ghost Face' scream from the Scream films is unforgettable, and it’s all thanks to Rodger Jackson, the voice actor behind the mask. I’ve crafted a chilling tribute to his tone, ideal for horror movie trailers, theme park promos, or anything needing a blood-curdling scream. It’s just one of many <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voice\">evil voiceovers</a> in my Halloween collection.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/veUdsSVFn6A","title":"Scream Ghost Face Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice.jpg","alt":"ghost-face-male-halloween-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A haunted collection of scary voices</h2>\r\n<p>Alongside this Ghost Face scream, I offer an entire crypt of creepy characters. Try my <a href=\"/dracula-voiceover-for-halloween\" title=\"Count Dracula Voice\">Count Dracula</a>, <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">Joker-style</a>, or <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky Halloween laughs</a>. These eerie voiceovers are perfect for everything from game trailers and haunted attractions to theme park events like <a href=\"/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice\" title=\"Alton Towers Scarefest Voice\">Alton Towers Scarefest</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Want this voice in your next horror project?</h2>\r\n<p>Whether you’re working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV commercial</a>, <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">game trailer</a>, or Halloween park announcement – I can record your scream-style voiceover fast. My studio delivers <strong>broadcast-quality audio</strong> with <strong>same-day turnaround</strong> in most cases. Need it urgently? Get in touch.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/halloween-voice-og.jpg","alt":"ghost-face-male-halloween-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Want this scary voice for your project?</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">Halloween commercial</a>, a <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">spooky narration</a>, or just want to give your content a scary edge, let's chat. I usually turn work around same-day, even during fright season.<br>\r\nVisit my <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">contact page</a>\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Scream Ghost Face Voiceover","pageUrl":"scary-movie-ghost-face-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","931",{"href":"/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg","alt":"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","582",{"href":"/homepage-showreel-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/homepage-showreel-voice.jpg","alt":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","804",{"href":"/what-is-explainer-video-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/what-is-explainer-video-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Explain the explainer voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Explaining the Explainer Video Voice?"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6",